s.\n4. `src/check/linearity.rs`: add arms to stream_uses, any_node, calls_in.\n5. Backends: emit_py.rs, emit_rs.rs, emit_js.rs, emit_lua.rs, emit_go.rs, emit_jq.rs, emit_llvm.rs.\n6. `runtime/toylang.c`: add sort_by/max_by runtime functions (for LLVM.\n7. Docs: docs/reference/builtins/sort_by.md, max_by.md.\n8. Corpus tests: add cases (sort_by_records.yaml, max_by_records.yaml, sort_by_strs.yaml, max_by_empty.yaml etc. Also reductions.rs-like checker tests for sort_by/max_by refusals (in a new tests file sort_by.rs? Let me check how tests are organized for sort. There's no sort.rs test file? The reductions.rs covers max refusal. Let me look for a sort refusal test.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_068ceaea2001NiN4FFxWnfDinF","sessionID":"ses_f97363172ffe9X2xJ1KPM1b5DB","messageID":"msg_068ce8fd7001NG1ei7FeACsI4A"}}
